{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15244080","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15244080","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1524408001:0":{"text":"Phew, everything's finally sorted.","source_cn":"呼……总算整理好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF24192630BE55ADC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1524408002:0":{"text":"Bium, how bad are the losses?","source_cn":"猎轰，损失情况怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0908F8BCF78F45E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1524408003:0":{"text":"We're all good. The trickfeathers didn't get a chance to eat anything.","source_cn":"还好，刁彩羽鹫还没来及下嘴，麦子基本都没事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0829487BD0794CF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1524408004:0":{"text":"I'm sorry, everyone... I'm just not good enough at magic...","source_cn":"对不起，大家……我……我的魔法造诣太差了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06C08656C8C8C241","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1524408005:0":{"text":"Hmph. I already said magic can't hold a candle to—","source_cn":"哼。我就说，魔法不如——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x582F8480523AB9A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1524408006:1":{"text":"Cut her some slack, Bium. There's hardly any damage.","source_cn":"好了好了，这不也没什么损失吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF522A2D9CFA777D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1524408007:1":{"text":"Roli, we know you want to help, but you should listen to your Mama next time. She knows more than you do.","source_cn":"绒利，我们知道你是想帮忙，但下次还是要听听你阿娘的话，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9A903B0799840AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1524408008:0":{"text":"I will....","source_cn":"……嗯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68DDB23425DEDEBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1524408009:0":{"text":"Alright, let's get back to work.","source_cn":"走吧，还有不少麦子要整理。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59896691D372551A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1524408010:0":{"text":"Master, I've let you down... I'll go back and practice harder!","source_cn":"老师，对不起，我让你们失望了……我，我回去会好好练习的...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0924F58816C2668A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Master, I've let you down... I'll go back and 